                                        <span class="a-declarative" data-action="a-popover" data-a-popover="{&quot;max-width&quot;:&quot;500&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;offerDisplayFeaturePackageInfoPopover-0&quot;,&quot;activate&quot;:&quot;onmouseover&quot;,&quot;position&quot;:&quot;triggerBottom&quot;,&quot;popoverLabel&quot;:&quot;Ships in product packaging&quot;}"> <a data-csa-c-content-id="odf-desktop-dynamic-package-info" data-csa-c-slot-id="odf-desktop-dynamic-package-info-anchor-text" data-csa-c-type="widget" class="a-link-normal a-popover-trigger a-declarative" href="javascript:void(0)" role="button"> <span class="a-size-small offer-display-feature-text-message">Ships in product packaging</span> </a> </span>   <div class="a-popover-preload" id="a-popover-offerDisplayFeaturePackageInfoPopover-0"> <div data-csa-c-content-id="desktop-dynamic-package-info" data-csa-c-slot-id="odf-desktop-dynamic-package-info-popover-description" data-csa-c-type="widget" class="a-section a-padding-base">  <div aria-level="5" class="a-row a-spacing-base" role="heading">  <img alt="black leaf" src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/G/01/siocLanding/icon-sustainability-20-black-2x.png" height="20px" width="20px"/> <span class="aok-inline-block aok-pre-line"></span>  <span class="a-text-bold">Ships in product packaging</span> </div>  <div class="a-row a-spacing-micro">    This item has been tested to certify it can ship safely in its original box or bag to avoid unnecessary packaging. Since 2015, we have reduced the weight of outbound packaging per shipment by 41% on average, that’s over 2 million tons of packaging material.    </div>  </div> </div>             </div>                                    </div>
