                <span>You will need to share the image of the item and its defects through </span><a class="a-link-normal" href="/gp/css/order-history"><span>Your Orders</span></a><span> for a refund/replacement.</span> </div> </div> </div>   <hr aria-hidden="true" class="a-divider-normal"/> <a class="a-link-emphasis" href="https://www.amazon.in/gp/help/customer/display.html/?ie=UTF8&amp;nodeId=201149900"> Read full returns policy </a>     </div> </div>  </div>                              <div id="icon-container-a8f40775-336e-424a-a058-ef91e4e38256" class="aok-hidden icon-farm-bottom-sheet a-scroller a-scroller-vertical">
