                              <div class="a-popover-preload" id="a-popover-pqvOverlay">             <div data-cel-widget="pqv-dpx-widget-desktop" data-csa-c-content-id="pqv-dpx-widget-desktop" data-csa-c-slot-id="pqv-dpx-widget-desktop" data-csa-c-type="popup" class="a-section a-padding-none celwidget">      <script type="text/javascript">(function(f) {var _np=(window.P._namespace("DetailPagePQVAssets"));if(_np.guardFatal){_np.guardFatal(f)(_np);}else{f(_np);}}(function(P) {
                P.now('pqv').execute(function(pqv) {
                    if (!pqv) {
                        P.register("pqv", function () {
                            return {
                                overlayType: 'desktop'
                            };
                        });
                    }
                });
            }));</script>         <h1 id="pqv-title"> Product Summary: Hyte Y70 Touch Infinite Dual Chamber ATX Mid Tower Modern Aesthetic Case with 14.9&#34; Integrated 2.5K IPS Touchscreen - Snow White </h1>    <p id="pqv-byline">From HYTE</p>               <div class="a-section a-spacing-medium">  <p id="pqv-ratings" data-target="#averageCustomerReviews_feature_div" class="a-spacing-none">  4.7 out of 5 stars, 331 ratings </p> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-reviews-action" data-pqv-reviews-action="{}"> <a id="pqv-reviews" data-target="#customer-reviews_feature_div" class="a-link-normal" href="?ref=dp_product_quick_view#customer-reviews_feature_div"> Customer reviews </a> </span>   </div>        <div class="a-section a-spacing-medium"> <h2 id="pqv-price"> Price </h2>             <p class="a-spacing-small">              <span class="a-text-bold"> One-time purchase: ₹45,669.00 </span>                  35% Savings   </p>         <p id="pqv-price-list-price" data-target="#corePriceDisplay_desktop_feature_div .basisPrice" class="a-spacing-small"> List Price: <span class="a-text-strike"> ₹69,990.00 </span> </p>                                              <p id="pqv-price-vat-message" class="a-spacing-small">  Inclusive of all taxes  </p>           <p class="a-text-italic"> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-buybox-action" data-pqv-buybox-action="{}"> <a id="pqv-buybox" data-target="#buybox" class="a-link-normal" href="?ref=dp_product_quick_view#buybox"> Purchasing options </a> </span> </p>                <p class="a-text-italic"> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-buying-options-action" data-pqv-buying-options-action="{}"> <a id="pqv-buying-options" data-target="#dynamic-aod-ingress-box" class="a-link-normal" href="?ref=dp_product_quick_view#dynamic-aod-ingress-box"> Other sellers </a> </span> </p> <p class="a-text-italic"> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-unqualified-buybox-action" data-pqv-unqualified-buybox-action="{}"> <a id="pqv-unqualified-buybox" data-target="#unqualifiedBuyBox" class="a-link-normal" href="?ref=dp_product_quick_view#unqualifiedBuyBox"> Other sellers </a> </span> </p>  </div>         <div id="pqv-feature-bullets" data-target="#featurebullets_feature_div" class="a-section a-spacing-medium"> <h2 id="pqv-feature-bullets-heading">About this Item</h2> <ul class="a-unordered-list a-vertical">  <li><span class="a-list-item">Mesmerizing 14.9” integrated LCD touchscreen with a 682 x 2560 (2.5K) resolution, 60Hz refresh rate, 10-point multi-touch capability, and extensive screen customization powered by HTYE Nexus software.</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">Larger 14.9&#34; display with a 43% brighter panel than before.</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">Unified modern aesthetic which is available in 4 unique colorways with a beautifully crafted 3-piece panoramic glass and dual chamber interior.</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">Massive 4 slot vertical graphics with an included luxury PCIE 4.0 x 16 riser which sports a color-matched canopy for uninterrupted visual flow.</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">Ginormous cooling capacity with support for up to a 360mm radiator on the side (125mm thick) and adjustable top (68mm thick) of the case along with cold floor cooling that can fit either a trio of 120mm or duo of 140mm fans up to 32mm thick down below.</span></li>  </ul> </div>           <div id="pqv-description" data-target="#productDescription_feature_div" class="a-section a-spacing-medium">  <h2 id="pqv-description-heading">Product description</h2>    <div>
                    Hyte Y70 Touch Infinite Dual Chamber ATX Mid Tower Modern Aesthetic Case with 14.9&#34; Integrated 2.5K IPS Touchscreen - Snow White  </div>
               </div>                        <div class="a-section a-spacing-medium"> <h2 id="pqv-options-available">Options Available</h2>    <h3>Colour</h3> <ul class="a-unordered-list a-vertical">  <li><span class="a-list-item"> Orange </span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item"> Panda </span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item"> Pitch Black </span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item"> Red </span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item"> Snow White </span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item"> black red </span></li>  </ul>  <h3>Style Name</h3> <ul class="a-unordered-list a-vertical">  <li><span class="a-list-item"> X50 Glass </span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item"> Y60 </span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item"> Y70 </span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item"> Y70 Touch Infinite </span></li>  </ul>  <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-twister-action" data-pqv-twister-action="{}"> <a id="pqv-twister" data-target="#twister-plus-inline-twister,#twister" class="a-link-normal" href="?ref=dp_product_quick_view#twister"> Browse all available options </a> </span> </div>                              <div class="a-section a-spacing-medium"> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-report-issue-action" data-pqv-report-issue-action="{}"> <a id="pqv-report-issue" data-target="#tellAmazon_feature_div" class="a-link-normal" href="?ref=dp_product_quick_view#tellAmazon_feature_div"> Report an issue with this product or seller </a> </span> </div>                     <div id="pqv-feedback" class="a-section a-spacing-medium"> <h2 id="pqv-feedback-heading">Feedback</h2> <p>Did you find this product summary feature useful?</p>   <div id="pqv-feedback-buttons-section" class="a-section"> <div class="a-section a-padding-base aok-float-left"> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-feedback-positive-action" data-pqv-feedback-positive-action="{}"> <span id="pqv-feedback-positive" class="a-button a-button-base"><span class="a-button-inner"><input id="pqv-feedback-positive-native" aria-described-by="Submit feedback that this product summary is useful" class="a-button-input" type="submit" aria-labelledby="pqv-feedback-positive-announce"/><span id="pqv-feedback-positive-announce" class="a-button-text" aria-hidden="true"> Yes, it is useful </span></span></span> </span> </div> <div class="a-section a-padding-base"> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-feedback-negative-action" data-pqv-feedback-negative-action="{}"> <span id="pqv-feedback-negative" class="a-button a-button-base"><span class="a-button-inner"><input id="pqv-feedback-negative-native" aria-described-by="Submit feedback that this product summary isn't useful" class="a-button-input" type="submit" aria-labelledby="pqv-feedback-negative-announce"/><span id="pqv-feedback-negative-announce" class="a-button-text" aria-hidden="true"> No, it is not useful </span></span></span> </span> </div> </div> <div id="pqv-feedback-submit-section" class="a-section aok-hidden"> <div class="a-section a-padding-base aok-float-left"> <div class="a-box a-alert-inline a-alert-inline-success aok-hidden" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"><div class="a-box-inner a-alert-container"><i class="a-icon a-icon-alert" aria-hidden="true"></i><div class="a-alert-content"> Thank you for your feedback </div></div></div> <div id="pqv-feedback-message-positive" class="a-box a-alert-inline a-alert-inline-success aok-hidden" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"><div class="a-box-inner a-alert-container"><i class="a-icon a-icon-alert" aria-hidden="true"></i><div class="a-alert-content"> Thank you for your feedback. You selected “Yes, it is useful” </div></div></div> <div id="pqv-feedback-message-negative" class="a-box a-alert-inline a-alert-inline-success aok-hidden" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"><div class="a-box-inner a-alert-container"><i class="a-icon a-icon-alert" aria-hidden="true"></i><div class="a-alert-content"> Thank you for your feedback. You selected “No, it is not useful” </div></div></div> </div> <div class="a-section a-padding-base"> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-feedback-reset-action" data-pqv-feedback-reset-action="{}"> <span id="pqv-feedback-reset" class="a-button a-button-base aok-hidden"><span class="a-button-inner"><input id="pqv-feedback-reset-native" class="a-button-input" type="submit" aria-labelledby="pqv-feedback-reset-announce"/><span id="pqv-feedback-reset-announce" class="a-button-text" aria-hidden="true"> Change your feedback </span></span></span> </span> </div> </div>    </div>  <div class="a-section a-spacing-medium"> <hr aria-hidden="true" class="a-divider-normal"/> <footer>
